      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm trying to put together a travel dossier for our engineering team's trip through SE Asia next month. They're hitting a few different stops like Singapore, Vietnam, and Indonesia, and I'm getting really confused about the difference between transit visas and full entry visas for some of these layovers. Can you give me a checklist or a breakdown of what we need to look out for so nobody gets stuck at a border or detained?",
