      "content": "For SE Asia, the distinction lies in whether your travel is a brief stopover or a full arrival. Transit visas are generally only needed if you are leaving the international transit area and entering the country, even briefly. Always check the specific \"visa-on-arrival\" or electronic travel authorization requirements for your nationality in each country, as these protocols change frequently. Consulting the official embassy websites for Singapore, Vietnam, and Indonesia is the safest way to ensure compliance for your engineering team.",
