      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start but it's a bit broad. specifically for the layovers—some of them are long, like 12+ hours. if they want to leave the airport to grab food or stay in a hotel near the terminal, is that automatically going to trigger an entry visa requirement? i'm worried about some of the more \"strict\" borders where things get complicated even if you're just passing through.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
